  "legal": {
    "terms_title": "Terms and conditions of service",
    "terms_updated": "Draft · pending legal review",
    "terms_intro": "These terms govern the use of kulinariamx.com and the purchase of Kulinaria MX meal plans (\"Kulinaria\", \"we\"). By creating an account or paying an order you accept these terms.",
    "terms_s1_t": "1. Account and data",
    "terms_s1_p": "To order you need an account with your real details (name, e-mail, phone and delivery address). You are responsible for the information you enter and for keeping your session secure. If you order for other people, you state that you have their permission to share their allergy and taste information with us.",
    "terms_s2_t": "2. Plans, prices and payment",
    "terms_s2_p": "We offer a 4-week plan (prepaid, 20 meals) and a 1-week plan (5 meals). Each plan has up to one meal per day, Monday to Friday. Prices are in Mexican pesos (MXN) and are shown before you pay; higher-tier dishes add a per-meal difference that is paid in the week they are chosen. Payment is made at Shopify's secure checkout and you must be signed in. The 4-week plan is paid upfront in a single charge. Each week you choose your dishes at no extra cost within your plan; only the difference for the higher-tier dishes you choose is charged separately, that same week. Renewal: when automatic renewal is active, the plan renews every 4 weeks with the same payment method until you cancel or pause it from your account before the Saturday 10:00 a.m. cut-off; while it is not active, we notify you before your block ends and nothing is charged without your confirmation.",
    "terms_s3_t": "3. Orders, cut-off and deliveries",
    "terms_s3_p": "Orders and each week's choices close on Saturdays at 10:00 a.m. (Mexico time). If you order before the cut-off, your first delivery is the following Monday; if you order after it, the Monday of the week after. Days you leave empty are not delivered and not charged. If you don't choose your dishes for a week you already bought, we repeat your previous selection. Deliveries are made within the coverage area and the time window shown at payment; you must receive your order or leave instructions for it.",
    "terms_s4_t": "4. Pauses, changes and cancellations",
    "terms_s4_p": "You can pause your deliveries from your account, for specific weeks or until you resume, before the Saturday 10:00 a.m. cut-off of the previous week. A paused week is not used up: your plan ends one week later for every week paused. Weeks whose cut-off has passed are prepared and are not refundable. 4-week plans are prepaid; early cancellation is handled case by case by writing to our contact e-mail, deducting the weeks already prepared or delivered.",
    "terms_s5_t": "5. Allergies, diets and food safety",
    "terms_s5_p": "Your allergy and taste profile is mandatory and helps us warn you when a dish contains or may contain something you declared. Our alerts are based on the ingredients and allergens we record for each dish; they are an aid, not a guarantee. We cook in a kitchen that handles several allergens (for example tree nuts, gluten, dairy, egg, fish and shellfish), so we cannot guarantee the absolute absence of traces. If your allergy is severe, consult your doctor and write to us before ordering.",
    "terms_s6_t": "6. Storage and containers",
    "terms_s6_p": "Dishes are delivered chilled in reusable or recyclable containers. Keep them refrigerated and eat them within the period shown on the label. When indicated, return returnable containers with the next delivery.",
    "terms_s7_t": "7. Discount codes and referrals",
    "terms_s7_p": "Discount codes have a limited number of uses and may expire; they cannot be exchanged for cash. The referral program and balances follow the rules published in your account and may change with notice.",
    "terms_s8_t": "8. Orders for other people",
    "terms_s8_p": "You can order for your partner, children or other people from a single account. You are responsible for entering their allergies correctly and for having their permission (or their guardian's, if they are a minor).",
    "terms_s9_t": "9. Intellectual property",
    "terms_s9_p": "The brands, photographs, texts and recipes on this site belong to Kulinaria MX or its licensors. You may not reproduce them without written permission.",
    "terms_s10_t": "10. Limitation of liability",
    "terms_s10_p": "To the extent permitted by law, Kulinaria MX is not liable for indirect damages, for incorrect information entered by the customer, or for delays caused by events beyond our control. Nothing above limits the rights that Mexico's Federal Consumer Protection Law gives you.",
    "terms_s11_t": "11. Changes to these terms",
    "terms_s11_p": "We may update these terms. The current version is the one published on this page with its update date; changes do not affect orders already paid.",
    "terms_s12_t": "12. Governing law and contact",
    "terms_s12_p": "These terms are governed by the laws of the United Mexican States. For any dispute, the parties submit to the competent courts of Mérida, Yucatán, without prejudice to consumer rights. Questions: [CONTACT E-MAIL] · [PHONE].",
    "privacy_title": "Privacy notice",
    "privacy_updated": "Draft · pending legal review",
    "privacy_intro": "In compliance with Mexico's Federal Law on the Protection of Personal Data Held by Private Parties (LFPDPPP), this notice explains how Kulinaria MX processes your personal data.",
    "privacy_s1_t": "1. Data controller",
    "privacy_s1_p": "[COMPANY NAME], trading as Kulinaria MX, address [ADDRESS], Mérida, Yucatán, Mexico, is responsible for processing your personal data. Contact: [CONTACT E-MAIL].",
    "privacy_s2_t": "2. Data we collect",
    "privacy_s2_p": "Identification and contact data (name, e-mail, phone), delivery data (address, references), account and order data, and payment data (processed by Shopify and the payment gateway; we do not store your card). We also collect sensitive data about your dietary health: allergies, diets and foods you cannot or do not want to eat, yours and, if you order for other people, theirs.",
    "privacy_s3_t": "3. Consent for sensitive data",
    "privacy_s3_p": "By entering your allergy and taste profile you expressly consent to our processing that data to prepare your dishes safely, warn you about ingredients or allergens and alert our kitchen. If you enter another person's data, you state that you have their permission or their guardian's.",
    "privacy_s4_t": "4. What we use your data for",
    "privacy_s4_p": "Necessary purposes: creating and managing your account, processing payments, preparing and delivering your orders, managing pauses and your week, answering questions and meeting legal and tax obligations. Additional purposes (you can object): sending reminders, promotions and news, and improving our service.",
    "privacy_s5_t": "5. Who we share your data with",
    "privacy_s5_p": "Only with providers that help us operate: Shopify (store, accounts and payments), Google (spreadsheets and e-mail to manage orders and reminders), delivery or messaging services and authorities when the law requires it. We do not sell your data.",
    "privacy_s6_t": "6. ARCO rights and revocation",
    "privacy_s6_p": "You may access, rectify, cancel or object to the processing of your data (ARCO rights), and revoke your consent, by writing to [CONTACT E-MAIL] with your name, account e-mail and request. We will answer within the legal time limits. You can correct much of your data yourself under \"My details\" in your account.",
    "privacy_s7_t": "7. Cookies and similar technologies",
    "privacy_s7_p": "We use cookies and browser storage to keep your session, remember your cart, language and selection, and measure site use. You can disable them in your browser, although some features may stop working.",
    "privacy_s8_t": "8. Retention and security",
    "privacy_s8_p": "We keep your data while you have an account or as legal obligations require, and apply reasonable security measures, including protected access to our order sheets.",
    "privacy_s9_t": "9. Changes to this notice",
    "privacy_s9_p": "Any change will be published on this page with its update date.",
    "contact_note": ""
  },
