    "01c0171bd876": "What our clients say",
    "54e81337b10f": "<p>Replace these texts with real client reviews.</p>",
    "57101557a8ad": "Testimonial to be defined",
    "e19abb95ae94": "<p>“Replace this text with a client's review.”</p>",
    "e67a5b94e6c5": "Frequently asked questions",
    "ca6c9a946b23": "Until when can I choose my dishes?",
    "199d06b9b2e0": "<p>Until Saturday at 10:00 AM. If you don't choose, the system builds your order from your plan, your history and your registered allergies.</p>",
    "ca0d21321ef8": "Can I pause my subscription?",
    "c6d4ea62165f": "<p>Yes. Pause Thursday and Friday deliveries by Tuesday 10:00 AM at the latest, and Monday to Wednesday deliveries by Friday 7:00 PM at the latest. Whatever isn't prepared stays as credit balance.</p>",
    "b40027af2eeb": "How do I pay?",
    "6189ddeea186": "<p>Everything is charged digitally on the website when you place your order. No cash is accepted.</p>",
    "d1714284bd0d": "What about the glass containers?",
    "4e28e0a09c83": "<p>Take care of them: a damaged or lost container carries a minimum charge of $100 MXN. Washing them isn't required.</p>",
    "b42bd506ecd9": "Are there refunds?",
    "dcbab62d3f81": "<p>We buy ingredients in bulk, so once the subscription is paid there is no cancellation or refund.</p>",
    "745ce12c1e3d": "Start your 4-week block",
    "9d9c94eb22b7": "Choose your plan, tell us about your allergies and we'll take care of the rest.",
    "c45d060436f5": "Order cut-off: Saturdays at 10:00 AM.",
    "fc33494e14ed": "Don't have a plan yet?",
