    "bb527eab0d98": "Prime and select seafood.",
    "7bcd7e76b685": "Cycle calendar",
    "5f16ab2de695": "How your week runs",
    "2b787069f959": "Saturday 10:00 AM",
    "7c154efbe6d7": "<p>Order cut-off. If you haven't chosen, your automatic order is built at 10:01 AM.</p>",
    "67e3c971a5b0": "Monday to Wednesday",
    "02cc098a0d21": "<p>First-half-of-the-week deliveries. Pause until Friday 7:00 PM.</p>",
    "b251f69974b9": "Tuesday 10:00 AM",
    "d5450c442208": "<p>Last moment to pause Thursday and Friday deliveries.</p>",
    "4833025847e5": "Thursday and Friday",
    "bb1f6c3b339a": "<p>Second-half deliveries. Friday 7:00 PM is the renewal cut-off.</p>",
    "49b69821cd1e": "Key policies",
    "e19e4c2414ab": "What you should know before subscribing",
    "d25d25949c37": "Digital payment, zero cash",
    "9cb072569cee": "<p>Every subscription or renewal is charged on the website when you place the order. Couriers carry no cash or change.</p>",
    "cd84d0cea8fb": "No refunds after payment",
    "bef32866cfc4": "<p>Ingredients are bought in bulk, so there is no cancellation of the current contract or refund. If you pause in time, meals not prepared are kept as credit balance.</p>",
    "9cfe260404c0": "Expiry through inactivity",
    "3173febf0eda": "<p>After a pause you have 30 calendar days to resume. After that the contract is cancelled and the accumulated balance is lost.</p>",
    "6a48791f90b3": "Premium healthy food delivered to your door, tailored to the client's lifestyle. An exclusive, direct and elegant experience.",
    "5b6aa3c8ac25": "The brand",
    "1e2fe67d8ab6": "Signature cooking, delivered to your door",
    "fdec8e48901f": "Purpose",
    "74dd9db9d6ed": "<p>That eating healthy shouldn't mean giving up pleasure: signature dishes, ready for your week.</p>",
    "6a46e3e8323d": "History and founder",
    "f452432d6131": "<p>Content to be defined: the brand story and a founder introduction.</p>",
    "1b531784d832": "Kitchen team",
    "b51e47f03871": "<p>Chefs who master fire, slow cooking and artisan reductions.</p>",
    "9271eec5da09": "We take care of every detail",
    "d82657e3df3a": "Premium ingredients",
    "21b485413e2a": "<p>Excellent-quality proteins, premium cuts and select seafood conditioned to reheat without losing their doneness.</p>",
    "b2a87160f6ee": "<p>High-quality containers that preserve flavour and can be reused. We appreciate you taking care of them.</p>",
    "471d4fa03da0": "The privilege of belonging",
    "f60dd1067c9b": "A clean interface, a direct service and dishes that feel exclusive. That's how we understand healthy food.",
    "3158b881b70c": "What guides us",
    "0f9ffb40acad": "<p>Every detail conveys the privilege of being part of the brand.</p>",
    "1ace92503bb9": "Signature cooking by levels",
    "d23fa96e0148": "<p>From Selecto, the everyday base menu, to Reserve, with Prime cuts and select seafood.</p>",
    "fa776c8a83c5": "Total transparency",
    "97d9ce020498": "<p>Declared ingredients, clear allergens and raw protein weight.</p>",
    "2a812499d15a": "Why this way",
    "5566da51fb56": "Efficiency you can taste on the plate",
    "3346e6bcefcd": "<p>We buy food in bulk to keep costs efficient. That's why we work in 4-week blocks and plan every cycle precisely.</p>",
    "9df8b219bcf1": "4-week blocks",
    "b262dde48d31": "<p>More stability for you and for the kitchen; a better price per dish.</p>",
    "b0771cca6a6c": "Weekly cycle",
    "207a0e7b8ab6": "<p>Cut-off on Saturdays at 10:00 AM, deliveries Monday to Friday.</p>",
    "ecbab319e40a": "See this week's specials",
    "903088298a99": "Ambassador program",
    "07888948faa6": "Recommend Kulinaria and earn with every client",
    "efb172199c7a": "Three branches to grow together: trainers (apparel and cash), clients (store credit) and partner gyms (high-volume cash flow).",
    "6167a0b38a0e": "I want to be an ambassador",
    "a83205f238a2": "Three branches",
    "ad5083b77965": "Choose how you want to take part",
    "14d1d1715d7e": "Apparel and cash",
    "9dcc1093140b": "<p>Join with your code and receive a cash bonus, the Fit Edition kit, a co-branded video and premium web status.</p>",
    "f049669ec666": "Viral store credit",
    "5407a1468c4e": "<p>Share your unique code and earn credit for every friend who buys their first block.</p>",
    "a72662425487": "High volume",
    "e4f47a36e5c3": "Partner gyms",
    "36f35da651ea": "<p>Passive monetization for your establishment with cash commissions and an elite bonus.</p>",
    "c51edd83ec38": "From the first goal to continuous growth",
    "3a1c529023f0": "First goal",
    "6acb394d85c0": "<ul><li>At least 10 new referred clients.</li><li>Each with at least 1 four-week block.</li><li>Invoices fully paid.</li></ul>",
    "81cde084ac29": "Activation (first 10)",
    "732585f78a09": "<ul><li>Welcome bonus: $1,500 MXN in cash.</li><li>Kulinaria Fit Edition Gear Kit: premium sportswear and thermal cup.</li><li>Co-branded promotional video.</li><li>Premium web status: High-Class Personal Trainer.</li></ul>",
    "1134435ce2cc": "Ongoing incentives (client 11 onwards)",
    "14ac6ba96394": "<ul><li>Route A: $100 MXN in cash for every renewal of an existing client.</li><li>Route B: $1,500 MXN in cash for every 10 new paid clients (20, 30, 40...).</li></ul>",
    "ed7c15b98983": "A passive monetization partnership",
    "8ce735c668fb": "Institutional code",
    "1773b15cbc0f": "<p>Sign up as a Partner Gym with a unique code (e.g. GYM_ZONE) for QR codes, reception and the club's social media.</p>",
    "1f19601245ac": "<ul><li>$100 MXN in cash for every new client on their first block.</li><li>$100 MXN each time that client renews.</li></ul>",
    "fd8e7a2ac1d1": "Ambassador Gym",
    "364e93207634": "<p>On reaching 100 active clients with paid blocks: a one-time $10,000 MXN bonus and a cross-marketing promotional video.</p>",
    "566e81f38ed2": "Clear rules",
    "d055c5978d63": "First to register, first to earn",
    "52b26dca70f2": "One client, one code",
    "fde9b79898cb": "<p>A client can only be linked to one referral code in the database. If a trainer registers their client with their code, that client is locked to that trainer and the gym's code can no longer apply; the renewal commission goes to the trainer only.</p>",
    "11fa8cd6fba5": "Acquisition channels",
    "61eef71d841e": "<p>General public (gym channel): lobby, counters, general QR codes, reception, club social media and organic traffic from members without a trainer. Private audience (trainer channel): one-to-one coaching clients, closed groups, friends and personal network, whether or not they train at the gym.</p>",
    "a51329ef01e8": "No interference",
    "c9269c04dc53": "<p>The partner gym acknowledges that independent trainers have private client lists and commits not to run re-sponsoring campaigns or forced code migration towards clients already registered with a trainer. Attempting it is grounds for immediate termination of the partnership.</p>",
    "b43f50210ae4": "High-Class Personal Trainers",
    "cef214379fba": "<p>Featured space for validated ambassadors. Add their profiles here.</p>",
    "25ccc48e31af": "Trainer to be defined",
    "dd8afc2c3a90": "<p>Photo, name and referral code.</p>",
    "7ab88c174940": "Request your ambassador code",
    "31763d96926f": "Tell us who you are and we'll contact you to activate your code.",
    "879f3de37161": "Send request",
    "06d92dba33f9": "Thank you. We'll be in touch very soon.",
    "dca0ee2604d9": "Beyond the subscription menu",
    "09bf510dc52f": "Ultra-premium, exclusively designed experiences: a private chef at home for special events and Saturday romantic dinners.",
    "ca457064e9b2": "Request a private quote",
    "36acf26a224d": "Designed to your measure",
    "048ed446abf7": "Private chef at home",
    "52b5ca2a2b2f": "<p>A signature menu prepared at your home for special events.</p>",
    "bf4826f76f5d": "Saturday romantic dinners",
    "14132b260633": "<p>A night planned down to the detail: ambience, menu and service.</p>",
    "a6061023ede9": "Special events",
    "f7314fcf27c9": "<p>Birthdays, anniversaries and intimate gatherings with the Kulinaria seal.</p>",
    "39d55c0f9f16": "Private quote",
    "ea3712fb1e39": "Tell us about your event",
    "271fee6af930": "This section has no cart or published prices. Each experience is quoted privately.",
    "8bbde61fa585": "Request a quote",
    "df92c85bdbbf": "Adhesion contract and terms of service",
    "26da6ae3bc4b": "Summary of the main clauses. The full version is accepted during sign-up, before payment.",
    "a9bec969c688": "1. Profile registration and delivery details",
    "3b4daf971255": "<p>Account holder's full name, exact address (cluster, street, lot, house and access references), main phone and a secondary subscriber: if the holder isn't available, the order may be delivered to that second person.</p>",
    "5dc8dfb86f5a": "2. Policies, waiting times and delivery logistics",
    "206c0b6456e5": "<p>The courier gives 5 courtesy minutes outside the home. After that they continue their route and you can pick up your order at no extra cost, agreeing a time with customer support first.</p>",
    "964b98c4699c": "3. Digital payment methods",
    "d734ccd287b8": "<p>Every subscription or renewal (4-week blocks or trial week) is processed digitally on the website when you place the order. Cash is not accepted under any circumstances.</p>",
    "c2270fe83381": "4. Glass containers and responsibility",
    "cba80d86dd5e": "<p>Any problem, breakage or loss of a container in the client's care carries a minimum charge of $100 MXN per container. Washing them isn't necessary, though we appreciate a rinse.</p>",
    "f1ed2f106c28": "5. No-refund policy and bulk purchasing",
    "da2923b1eebe": "<p>Ingredients are bought in bulk, so once the subscription is paid there is no cancellation of the current contract or refund. What you've invested isn't lost if you pause in time: meals not prepared remain as credit balance.</p>",
    "10d422d467ad": "6. Operational pause windows",
    "f3b98897a7a2": "<ul><li>Thursday and Friday pause: by Tuesday 10:00 AM at the latest.</li><li>Monday to Wednesday pause: by Friday 7:00 PM at the latest.</li><li>If you don't pause before Friday 7:00 PM, your new order is assigned on Saturday at 10:00 AM and charged to your current plan.</li></ul>",
    "b39b5b766428": "7. Contract expiry through inactivity",
    "d9ebd8764d27": "<p>After a pause you must resume within a maximum of 30 calendar days. Otherwise the contract is cancelled permanently, the accumulated balance is lost and you'll need to pay for a new contract to return.</p>",
    "d48f75408287": "8. Weight specification (raw weight)",
    "4029ced1f8c1": "<p>Protein quantities correspond to gross raw weight before preparation. Cooking, fire-searing or reduction cause natural shrinkage, so the net weight served will be lower than published.</p>",
    "793a73ace38a": "9. Disclaimer for allergies and allergens",
    "44084a089bb2": "<p>The user is solely responsible for declaring their allergies and restrictions in detail when signing up. The site generates alerts and blocks based on the data entered; Kulinaria is exempt from liability for omissions or errors by the user when recording their medical or dietary history.</p>",
    "958cfd97f1cc": "10. Automatic Saturday selection",
    "ea7b382ab600": "<p>If you don't register your dishes before Saturday at 10:00 AM, the system generates an automatic order with your plan, history and, always, your registered allergies.</p>",
